'''The Dream World''' (Korean: '''꿈의 세계''' ''Kkumui Segye'') is the third ending theme for the Korean dub of ''[[Pokémon the Series: Sun & Moon]]''. It debuted in [[SM127]], replacing [[With You]]. It uses the same animation from the corresponding Japanese ending theme, [[Type: Wild]].

==Ending animation==
===Synopsis===
{{Rotom}} shows video footage of some of the moments from each episode, as {{Ash}} and {{AP|Pikachu}}; {{an|Mallow}} and {{TP|Mallow|Tsareena}}; {{an|Lana}} and [[Sandy]]; {{an|Kiawe}}, {{TP|Kiawe|Turtonator}}, and {{TP|Kiawe|Marowak}}; {{an|Lillie}} and [[Snowy]]; and {{an|Sophocles}} and {{TP|Sophocles|Togedemaru}} run alongside it. Ash, Pikachu and {{ashcl}} then pose for a photo taken by Rotom.

